# Downloaded fonts stay out of the repository.
*.ttf

# TH SarabunPSK is the exception and IS committed. It is the face named in the
# government typing rules (ระเบียบสำนักนายกรัฐมนตรีว่าด้วยงานสารบรรณ), and unlike
# Google's Sarabun it has no stable download URL to fetch at build time, so the
# only way to guarantee the memo prints correctly on every server is to ship it.
# Its licence (DIP & SIPA) grants the right to "reproduce ... and distribute".
!THSarabunPSK-Regular.ttf
!THSarabunPSK-Bold.ttf
!THSarabunPSK-Italic.ttf
!THSarabunPSK-BoldItalic.ttf
